  Full-request estimate unavailable;
  conversation counts alone cannot
  establish pricing or compact headroom.
  Favor shake when it delays compaction,
  not simply before /compact.

  Conversation excludes instructions/tools.
  Costs exclude recovery and output; not
  plan-allowance predictions.


